<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Confirm your email</h1>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#58534a;">Hi {{name}}, please confirm this is your email address to finish setting up your {{brand.name}} account.</p>
{{> button url=verificationUrl label="Verify email address"}}
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#948d80;">This link expires in {{expiresInHours}} hours. If you did not create an account, you can ignore this email.</p>
